te a `ArrayMeshTest` resource and try sliding the `length` property, then Godot editor interrupts the sliding.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102201/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}